    "detailed_description": "<h1>Comments? Concerns? Come join us in our official discord.</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/fb2e3ed543ccbcc532afdde0abe37053.poster.avif?t=1636712213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/fb2e3ed543ccbcc532afdde0abe37053.webm?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/fb2e3ed543ccbcc532afdde0abe37053.mp4?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Zoo Squad</strong> is a multiplayer party brawler for 4 players.<br>You will win by fighting your friends using a variety of cute animals.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play online with your friends.<br></li><li>Unique levels.<br></li><li>Random ability box.<br></li><li>Lots of animals.<br></li><li>Lots of original music.<br></li><li>Support cross-platform.</li></ul><br><strong>PLAY WITH YOUR FRIENDS</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/18034502fd99dbb3fe4f805923274424.poster.avif?t=1636712213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/18034502fd99dbb3fe4f805923274424.webm?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/18034502fd99dbb3fe4f805923274424.mp4?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>GRAB THE ABILITY BOX</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/4510f4b546e8e2e1b36cc3084dccf0d6.poster.avif?t=1636712213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/4510f4b546e8e2e1b36cc3084dccf0d6.webm?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/4510f4b546e8e2e1b36cc3084dccf0d6.mp4?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>LOTS OF ANIMALS</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/e08e7e75b306113a9070c538dfbe5297.poster.avif?t=1636712213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/e08e7e75b306113a9070c538dfbe5297.webm?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1738480/extras/e08e7e75b306113a9070c538dfbe5297.mp4?t=1636712213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
